# DoJa audio support has been merged in!

Back in May, _Guy Perfect_ kindly wrote and donated an MA-3 music emulator
for DoJa! This has now been merged in! This is supported for both Windows
and Linux. For Linux you will need Open Source System support, either
natively, with ALSA emulation (`snd_pcm_oss` and `alsa-oss`), or with
the PulseAudio/PipeWire daemon `osspd`.

Do note that if audio is playing for DoJa in _SpringCoat_ the performance
will be very sluggish as there is no acceleration support currently, you
will have to run the _Hosted_ version.

There may be some audio issues on Windows as that is not my main development
system.
